; One variable: `layout_direction = 3` beside VC_GLYPHS_AUTO, the one visible_characters_behavior
; that takes its reveal end from the layout direction (label.cpp:779-780): LTR hides the tail,
; RTL the head. Both Labels share text and budget. unit-label-visible-characters.tscn pins
; VC_CHARS_BEFORE_SHAPING with no direction, so this is invisible there.

